  "suggested_fix": "Add a real check before computing any index, for example 'if (!fclks->num_levels) return;' (keeping the ASSERT for debugging if wanted). Also make sure num_levels does not exceed the size of the data array (DM_PP_MAX_CLOCK_LEVELS), for example by clamping it, so every computed index stays within bounds."
}

